  <section>
    <h2>Websites, blogs, digital gardening and content ownership</h2>

    <p>I've been seeing this concept of digital gardens around for a while now and the concept serves my needs so well. I really like the idea of having a single place to archive and display stuff I make/work with.</p>

    <p>I also love not having to wait for things to be "done" before posting them, be it in a blog or anywhere else. I was heavily inspired by <a href="https://joelhooks.com/" target="_blank">Joel Hook's digital garden</a> while making mine, be sure to check his.</p>
